#             HUMANS                #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #           JAANOSIANS              #                                   #These are a slowly developing race #who are inexperienced with regards #to space exploration.              #They have limited armed forces and #are mostly peaceful.               #they have a few colonies from where#they mine ores.                    #                                   #                                   #                                   #          THE MORGRULS             #                                   #Space Pirates who destroy weaker   #races then colonise their planets. #The Morgruls have a highly advanced#technology level and some          #devastating weaponry. They are     #currently involved in a battle     #against the League, who have       #recaptured some Morgrul planets.   #                                   #                                   #            THE KALLS              #                                   #A Merchant race who survive by     #transferring goods between planets.#They are financially stable at     #present, although always at        #the mercy of market forces.        #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #           PHELONIANS              #                                   #A strong but peaceful race who     #devote their lives to              #self-improvement through meditation#and quiet reflection.              #They are rarely defeated.          #They are currently in need of Ores #and minerals as they have exhausted#the supply on their own planet.    #                                   #                                   #            THE ERAN               #                                   #A technologically backward race,   #but possessing the natural ability #to metamorph.                      #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #          THE LISONIANS            #                                   #The leaders of "The League".       #A very strong and aggressive race, #the Lisonians desire to manipulate #the other league members to achieve#their own ends.                    #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #           UNDORLINGS              #                                   #The sole motivation for the        #Undorlings is to utterly defeat the#Morgruls. They strongly object to  #the meddling policies of the       #Lisonians and this causes friction #within the league.                 #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #           THE HIRACHI             #                                   #A peace loving people who support  #the Lisonians because they were    #helped by them in previous times of#trouble.                           #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #          THE DRUEDIANS            #                                   #This weak race have been driven    #from their homes by the pirates and#are now wandering through space.   #They therefore make a very small   #contribution to league affairs.    #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #          THE SYONIANS             #                                   #A mysterious people with strong    #telepathic abilities.              #Earth is controlled by             #one of the Syonians.               #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #                                   #          THE EARTHLINGS           #                                   #                                   #The Earthlings are under the       #telepathic influence of a renegade #Syonian. Although most people are  #unaware of this fact, a few have   #discovered the truth and are       #preparing a revolt against the     #Syonian.                           #                                   #                                   